This repository (the "Project") is an independent educational and research
project. It analyzes the visual and interaction design of publicly available
product landing pages and publishes the results as a gallery of design
teardowns. Everything published here is intended to be publishable material:
factual design observations, original written analysis and commentary, CSS
reimplemented by the Project's contributors, and low-resolution screenshots
used for the purpose of commentary and illustration.

